    <briefdescription>
<para>Helper struct to manage generating runtime checks for vectorization. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The runtime checks are created up-front in temporary blocks to allow better estimating the cost and un-linked from the existing IR. After deciding to vectorize, the checks are moved back. If deciding not to vectorize, the temporary blocks are completely removed. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
